#: .\templates\components\home\item.html:94
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    The future is not awaited. It is recognized.\n"
"                    "
msgstr "\n                    Auf die Zukunft wartet man nicht. Man erkennt sie.\n                    "

#: .\templates\components\home\item.html:101
